<title>BELGIUM: Belgian February bankruptcies down 7.6 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Belgian February bankruptcies down 7.6 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company bankruptcies in Belgium fell by 53 to 645 in February compared with February 1996, Belgian trade and company data group Infotrade said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>In the first two months of 1997 a total of 1,413 companies went bankrupt, up from 1,261 in the same 1996 period.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
